    "finalWords": "Lil peep has a distinct sound, though the consistency of the album tends to have patches of unmixed or out of pitch parts from features. Most notably, Absolute in doubt for Wicca or Cold Hart's section in big city blues. Three tracks that are staple rotations. The genre is consistent, but the mixing is not. Great usage of samples.",
